@startuml
title gitbucket-e2e-specs — testing a GitBucket pull request

!include diagram-style.iuml

component "<owner>/gitbucket@<branch>\n(built from source)" as Branch
component "Run workflow e2e\n(gitbucket: release or ref)" as Dispatch
component "GitBucket release\n(e.g. 4.48.0, downloaded)" as Release
component "get-gitbucket.sh" as Get
component "start-gitbucket.sh\n(new, empty instance)" as Start
component "<b>npx playwright test</b>" as Tests #DDEBF7
component "run summary\n(GitBucket under test, results)" as Summary
component "pull request\ndescription" as PR

Branch --> Get
Dispatch --> Get
Release --> Get
Get --> Start : gitbucket.war
Start --> Tests
Tests --> Summary
Summary --> PR : run link

note right of PR
  one run on the branch,
  one on the last release:
  same tests, both links
end note

note left of Get
  branch: resolved when the run starts,
  a new push needs a new run
end note

@enduml
